{"id": "QuestString_STR_HQ2103600_complete_desc", "canonicalSource": "???", "sourceCulture": "ko-KR", "source": "때를 기다리자", "sourceSha256": "51953c831d57ff7cb0c8c69631eff169fdf6e0a7253e7a1c0f6c6b1e80c9b5a5", "translation": "Poczekaj na właściwy moment", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "QuestString_STR_HQ2103600_quest_short_summary", "canonicalSource": "???", "sourceCulture": "ko-KR", "source": "새로운 지역으로 갈 날을 기다리자", "sourceSha256": "0d7510ad015cf17b93135a1513b752cb7309ffd40128e0252bc853e36ecbd2f5", "translation": "Poczekaj, aż będzie można udać się do nowego regionu", "status": "draft"}
